  "description": "The meme is an example of ableism — discrimination or prejudice against people with disabilities — by portraying the woman as an object of pity or amusement rather than as a person with agency and dignity. It normalizes viewing disability through a lens of pity or mockery, which can contribute to negative societal perceptions.",
